TEXT -40 128 Left 2 ;NOTE:\nFor the line noload case the values are the same\nFor the three phase fault the values are the same\nBUT:\nFor the One phase earth fault the values differs !!!\nThis is because of coupling\nTherefore for the unsymmetric case always use the coupled models\nto get proper results.
